    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for our board regarding our new credit scoring models. We're trying to align our engineering practices with our ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) targets. Can you explain why optimizing our algorithm for 'equality of outcome' is the most ethically sound approach for us to take here?",
